usage:
Optional Extension configuration:
{"clock":"[time:%H:%M:%S;Europe/Brussels]","font_family":"doto","font_size":18,"speed":1.0,"density":0.8,"trail_length":1.0}

clock is an optional [time:...] binding. Include seconds so the extension can schedule rain-head collisions; it displays only HH:MM. Normal rain skips clock cells and changed digits apply when planned heads cross them. Existing digit-lane trails finish naturally; slow rain can reserve a later reachable minute. A pending update falls back to a direct update 10 seconds after the time binding reports the new minute. The widget must be at least five character cells wide for the clock. Specify an Olson timezone after a semicolon; no timezone uses UTC. font_family accepts default, dseg7, bebas, or doto. font_size accepts the firmware's compiled font sizes from 12 to 48 pixels. speed ranges from 0.1 to 12.0, density from 0.0 to 1.0, and trail_length from 0.25 to 2.0. Configure the widget-level extension_tick_interval_ms from 33 to 1000 milliseconds to control animation cadence.
